1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Float Lyrics. Your music, a little closer.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
1. Choose your player.
••• → Music Player → Spotify or Apple Music.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
2. Play a song in the desktop app.
Allow Automation if macOS asks.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Keep working. Lyrics follow automatically.
Drag the lyric window wherever you like.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
3. Move to your notch.
••• → Move to Dynamic Island.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Click the island to expand.
Move away to tuck it back.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Back to the window?
Expand the island, then click the window arrow.

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,000
4. Make it comfortable.
••• → Settings → Appearance.

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Choose Window or Island and adjust opacity.
Only the background fades; lyrics stay crisp.

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Choose a lyric-color swatch.
More options has custom colors.

11
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Return to your work.
Your changes save automatically.

12
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Float Lyrics. Free. Open source. Made for Mac.
Download → Applications → Open.
